   "text": "University of Stirling (UAE) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Stirling (UAE)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Stirling is an international university based in the UK, recognised across the globe for addressing the needs of society through innovative interdisciplinary research; learning and teaching of the highest quality; and sharing our knowledge with the world. Continuing our tradition for innovation and internationalisation, our campus in Ras Al Khaimah, United Arab Emirates (UAE), formally opened its doors in 2018. The campus enables our students to undertake prestigious courses developed by expert academics from the University of Stirling, delivered internationally in the UAE.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:22\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:22\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Arab Emirates\nYearly Fees\nMax: AED 50,000.00\nMin: AED 25,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n60 of 600 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2018\nCampus(es)\nRas Al Khaimah\nCountry\nUnited Arab Emirates\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n06/03/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.stir.ae/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.stir.ae/fees-scholarship\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WSKDziJxSL8\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
